+## YouTube profile lock and staged v2 audit (2026-10-21)
+
+YouTube now opens only in Chrome's `Default` profile, matching the “Comedy with - Chrome” desktop shortcut. Saved settings are `media.youtube_browser: "user_chrome"`, `media.youtube_chrome_profile: "Default"`, and `media.youtube_profile_only: true`. The lock overrides the separate-browser mode. Searches, video/playlist launches, explicit YouTube links, planner browser navigation, Windows command 88 and project-open YouTube launches use this profile. If launch or playback cannot be confirmed, Jarvis reports the problem and opens no fallback browser. Mixed Windows command batches containing YouTube must open YouTube separately. Restart Jarvis to load this update; existing Chrome sessions remain open.
