+Fresh unchanged baseline: **3,835 passed / 152 skipped / 1 warning**. Full post-change regression: **3,851 passed / 152 skipped / 1 warning** (1,222.18 s). Profile and old media regression: **107 passed / 1 existing COM warning**. Real user-confirmed Chrome playback passed pause/resume/status readbacks through text parsing, ToolRegistry, Actions and Windows media sessions, with private title redacted and playing state restored. Five warm status calls measured p50 **18.509 ms**, p95 **20.677 ms** in the verification harness; this is not microphone, running GUI or v2 MCP acceptance. Launcher readiness now reports **ready** for configured dependencies/services; historical readiness results below retain their original context.
